Subject: [PATCH 49/49] =?UTF-8?q?fix(akibot):=20pr=C3=A9paration=20des=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?haders=20(KYTY=5FPIPELINE=5FLIST=5FPREPARE)=20en=20mode=20hybri?=
 =?UTF-8?q?de=20sur=20int21?=
